WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.463
Week 12: Shopping, Clothing, and Demonstratives. ask for an item and size compare price and fit return or exchange a purchase

2
00:00:08.463 --> 00:00:15.092
Mission brief. Choose clothing for a formal event and negotiate an exchange for the wrong size.

3
00:00:15.092 --> 00:00:24.497
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:24.497 --> 00:00:32.277
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:32.277 --> 00:00:40.805
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:40.805 --> 00:01:06.871
Model language. ¿Tiene esta camisa en otra talla? — Do you have this shirt in another size? Esos zapatos me quedan bien. — Those shoes fit me well. Aquella chaqueta es demasiado cara. — That jacket over there is too expensive. Quiero devolver este artículo. — I want to return this item. El precio incluye los impuestos. — The price includes taxes.

7
00:01:06.871 --> 00:01:16.769
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
